egendary Creature — Human Archer', 'Legendary Creature — Human Artificer', 'Legendary Creature — Human Assassin', 'Legendary Creature — Human Cleric', 'Legendary Creature — Human Druid', 'Legendary Creature — Human Knight', 'Legendary Creature — Human Pirate', 'Legendary Creature — Human Rogue', 'Legendary Creature — Human Shaman', 'Legendary Creature — Human Soldier', 'Legendary Creature — Human Warrior', 'Legendary Creature — Human Wizard', 'Legendary Creature — Insect Wizard', 'Legendary Creature — Kobold', 'Legendary Creature — Shapeshifter', 'Legendary Creature — Zombie Wizard', 'Legendary Land', 'Sorcery', 'World Enchantment']
